  "theorem": "The q=3 hole graph is an equitable eight-state F2^3 fibre extension of the q=2 S6 duad carrier. Its missing block relation is exactly KG(6,2), and in characteristic two its adjacency is a rank-40 differential with 40-dimensional image, homology, and coimage.",
